{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for CrushVibe', 'description': 'Primary container for CrushVibe implementation: A playful single-page web app where users enter their name and their crush\'s name to receive a fun, randomly generated romantic message, with options to generate a flirty DM line and reset the app. The design features a soft pastel gradient background, floating heart animations, a large cursive title, pastel-toned input fields, glossy buttons, and a clean, responsive layout. Built using only HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. EXAMPLE MESSAGES TO INCLUDE (for random output):\n“They like you... and your dog pics 🐶”\n\n“This is giving mutual situationship 💅”\n\n“They play cool but their heart races 🥹”\n\n“It’s a NO from the universe, bbg 💔”\n\n“They saved your reel... TWICE. It’s fate 😳”\n\n“Stop playing, you’re the crush 😏”\n\n“You should shoot your shot. Right now. 💘”\n\n“They think about you at 3am 👀✨”\n\nCrush-O-Meter is a flirty, funny, and super aesthetic single-page web app where users input their name and their crush’s name — and the app gives them a sassy, random compatibility verdict. Perfect for Gen-Z, teens, or any cutie who just wants to play around and laugh. It\'s like a love oracle… but with ✨attitude✨.\n\n🌸 AESTHETIC & VIBE:\nElement\tStyle\nColor palette\tPastel pinks, lavender, soft peach, baby blue\nFont\tPoppins or Quicksand for clean texts + Pacifico for logo text\nLayout\tCentered box layout with soft rounded corners and shadow\nBackground\tFaint gradient with floating hearts/stars animation\nButtons\tGlossy 3D soft pink, hover grows slightly and sparkles\nVibe\tClean, playful, sweet, baddie-coded 💅\n\n20 Flirty DM Lines for Your App:\n"Are you Netflix? Because I could stare at you all night."\n\n"You\'re the reason my phone lights up and my heart speeds up 😘"\n\n"I was going to play it cool, but damn... you’re distracting me."\n\n"Stop being cute. I\'m trying to be normal here."\n\n"You’ve been living rent-free in my head all week 🧠💘"\n\n"Sooo… when are you taking me out? Asking for a friend 😏"\n\n"If I had a crush on anyone else, I’d be lying."\n\n"You make blushing a full-time job 😳"\n\n"Wanna be the reason I cancel all my plans this weekend? 👀"\n\n"You like me. Just admit it already."\n\n"If flirting was a crime, I’d be guilty. With you as my partner-in-crime 🔥"\n\n"I wish I was your phone so you\'d touch me all the time 😩📱"\n\n"Tell me your favorite movie so I can pretend to like it too 😇"\n\n"Lowkey? Highkey? I want to kiss you. Constantly."\n\n"I swear your smile should be illegal. Too powerful."\n\n"If you don’t message me first, I might cry… cutely."\n\n"Hey, stop looking so good. I’m trying to focus here."\n\n"If we were in a group project, I’d do all the work… just to sit next to you."\n\n"You up? Just thinking about you… and maybe marrying you 😅"\n\n"Plot twist: I’ve had a crush on you since forever. 😳"', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "CrushVibe-38973 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Pastel Gradient Background with Floating Hearts",\n      "description": "The background uses a soft pastel gradient with animated floating heart icons for a dreamy, romantic vibe.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Large Cursive Title",\n      "description": "The app title \'Crush-O-Meter \\ud83d\\udc98\' is centered at the top in a large, cursive Pacifico font for a playful look.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Pastel Rounded Input Boxes",\n      "description": "Two centered input boxes for \'Your Name\' and \'Your Crush\'s Name\', styled with pastel colors, rounded edges, and soft shadows.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Glossy Pink Action Button",\n      "description": "A large, glossy pink button labeled \'Scan the Vibe \\ud83d\\udc98\' triggers a random romantic message.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Playful Romantic Message Display",\n      "description": "A styled result box displays a randomly chosen, playful romantic message after scanning.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Flirty DM Line Generator",\n      "description": "A smaller button generates and displays a cute, flirty pickup line in the result box.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Reset Button",\n      "description": "A reset button at the bottom clears all inputs and results, allowing users to start again.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive Design",\n      "description": "The layout adapts to different screen sizes for mobile and desktop users.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Soft Shadows and Heart Iconography",\n      "description": "UI elements use soft shadows and heart icons for a fun, aesthetic feel.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Font Styling",\n      "description": "Poppins font is used for all text except the title, which uses Pacifico.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#F8E1F4",\n    "secondary": "#B2E0F7",\n    "accent": "#FF7EB9"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI is vertically centered with a large, cursive title at the top. Below are two pastel, rounded input fields, followed by a large, glossy pink button. The result box appears under the button, with a smaller button for generating a flirty DM line. A reset button is placed at the bottom. Floating heart animations overlay the pastel gradient background. All elements are centered, spaced with soft shadows, and responsive for mobile and desktop."\n}'}",
